# Seasoned Warrenguard: the token must be one "you control". Bot2 controls a Spirit token (Group Project) and Bot1 none, so the
# attacking Warrenguard stays 1/2 and deals 1 (CR 111.1, 109.4).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Seasoned Warrenguard
Plains x18

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Pearl
Group Project
Island x17

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Seasoned Warrenguard.Cast
